# SUBMISSIONS_FOLDER_MAP: JSON object with exactly these fixed assignment keys:
# stat1-a01, stat1-a02, stat1-a03, stat2-a01, stat2-a02, stat2-a03,
# sem-a01, sem-a02, sem-a03.
# Values are verified PRIVATE Drive assignment folder IDs, not course browsing folders.
# No secret values or actual student data are included in this example.
# The register must be an app-authorized, owner-only spreadsheet with the v1 header.
# SUBMISSIONS_REGISTER_SHEET_ID is the numeric tab ID, including 0 when applicable.
